text:
⚠️ nodkey: Telegram reports a conflict: another program reads the updates of this bot, or a webhook is set. The bot token may be stolen. The broker no longer takes answers, so it denies every request that needs a tap. Make a new token with @BotFather, put it in the token file, and restart the broker.
